c-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1a6.7 6.7 0 0 1-3.3-2.9c-.3-.4.2-.4.7-1.3.1-.2 0-.3 0-.4l-.8-1.8c-.2-.5-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5c-.2 0-.4.1-.6.3-.2.2-.8.8-.8 2s.8 2.3 1 2.5c.1.2 1.6 2.5 4 3.5 1.5.6 2 .7 2.8.6.4-.1 1.5-.6 1.7-1.2.2-.6.2-1.1.1-1.2l-.4-.2z'/></svg> Ask us on WhatsApp</a></div><div class='am-facts'><span>Private trips only</span><span>Pickups at the airport, riad or hotel</span><span>Day trips, tours &amp; activities</span></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh01w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh'><div><span class='am-eb'>Where to start</span><h2>Pick the <em>kind</em> of trip you have time for</h2></div><p>One free day, a few nights in the desert or the whole country. Choose a starting point and we'll adjust the details with you.</p></div><div class='am-kinds'><a class='am-kind' href='#day-trips'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/buggy-tour-agafay-desert-view-1536x864-1-600x810.jpg' alt='Day trips' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/buggy-tour-agafay-desert-view-1536x864-1.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><div class='am-kind-b'><span class='am-kind-n'>5 trips</span><h3>Day trips</h3><p>Out of Marrakech in the morning, back for dinner.</p><span class='am-go'>Show me</span></div></a><a class='am-kind' href='#tours'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-mographe-30254941-600x810.jpg' alt='Multi-day tours' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-mographe-30254941.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><div class='am-kind-b'><span class='am-kind-n'>5 tours</span><h3>Multi-day tours</h3><p>Mountains, kasbahs and nights in the Sahara.</p><span class='am-go'>Show me</span></div></a><a class='am-kind' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/activities/'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-leos-37736075-600x810.jpg' alt='Activities' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-leos-37736075-scaled.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><div class='am-kind-b'><span class='am-kind-n'>4 activities</span><h3>Activities</h3><p>Balloons at sunrise, quads, camels and dinner shows.</p><span class='am-go'>Show me</span></div></a></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh02w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--white'><div class='am-w am-split'><div class='am-arch'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/amasir-guests-marrakech-airport.jpg' alt='Amasir Voyage guide with four smiling travellers at Marrakech Menara airport' width='1600' height='1200' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><div class='am-stamp' aria-hidden='true'><svg viewBox='0 0 136 136'><defs><path id='amc' d='M68 68m-50 0a50 50 0 1 1 100 0a50 50 0 1 1-100 0'/></defs><text font-family='Inter,sans-serif' font-size='11.5' font-weight='600' letter-spacing='3.2' fill='#221C17'><textPath href='#amc'>PRIVATE TOURS &#183; MARRAKECH &#183; MOROCCO &#183; </textPath></text></svg><b>&#10022;</b></div></div><div class='am-tx'><span class='am-eb'>We are Amasir Voyage</span><h2>Morocco, the way we'd show <em>a friend</em></h2><p>We're a small team of drivers and guides based in Marrakech. A lot of our trips start the same way: we meet you at arrivals, load the bags, and on the drive into town we talk about what you actually want to see.</p><p>Some guests want the big loop over the Atlas to the Sahara. Others have one free day and just want to get out of the medina for a few hours. Either way the trip is private, planned around you, with sensible driving days and stops wherever there's something worth stopping for.</p><span class='am-sign'>&#8212; the Amasir team</span><div class='am-btns' style='margin-top:30px'><a class='am-btn am-btn--line' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/about/'>More about us</a></div></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh03w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--sand' id='day-trips'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh'><div><span class='am-eb'>Day trips from Marrakech</span><h2>Out in the morning, <em>back for dinner</em></h2></div><p>Pickup from your riad or hotel, a private car and driver, and the day at your pace.</p></div><div class='am-trips'><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/agafay-desert-day-trip/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/buggy-tour-agafay-desert-view-1536x864-1-705x540.jpg' alt='Agafay Desert Day Trip' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/buggy-tour-agafay-desert-view-1536x864-1.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>Day trip</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Agafay Desert Day Trip</h3><p>The stony desert just outside Marrakech, with the Atlas on the horizon. Optional camel or quad, then sunset and dinner at a camp.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/imlil-high-atlas-mountains-day-trip/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/images.jpg' alt='Imlil & High Atlas Mountains' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>Day trip</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Imlil &amp; High Atlas Mountains</h3><p>Berber villages, walnut terraces and the foot of Toubkal, about an hour and a half from the city.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/ouzoud-waterfalls-day-trip/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/sf26aalgw5y00sc66eqk-705x469.jpg' alt='Ouzoud Waterfalls' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/sf26aalgw5y00sc66eqk.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>Day trip</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Ouzoud Waterfalls</h3><p>The big falls in the Middle Atlas, olive groves on the way down and the local macaques.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/essaouira-day-trip-from-marrakech/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.05.03-PM-705x540.jpeg' alt='Essaouira from Marrakech' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.05.03-PM.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>Day trip</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Essaouira from Marrakech</h3><p>Blue boats, the old ramparts and grilled fish by the port, on the Atlantic coast.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/ourika-valley-day-trip-from-marrakech/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.07.24-PM1-705x540.jpeg' alt='Ourika Valley' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.07.24-PM1.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>Day trip</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Ourika Valley</h3><p>A green river valley in the Atlas foothills. An easy first day out of the city.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh04w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--ink' id='tours'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh'><div><span class='am-eb'>Multi-day tours</span><h2>A few nights <em>further out</em></h2></div><p>Over the Atlas to the dunes, north to the blue city, or the whole country. Every itinerary can be stretched, shortened or reshuffled.</p></div><div class='am-trips'><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/3-day-merzouga-desert-adventure/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-mographe-30254941-705x540.jpg' alt='3-Day Merzouga Desert Adventure' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-mographe-30254941.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>3 days</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>3-Day Merzouga Desert Adventure</h3><p>Over the Atlas and down the valleys to the Erg Chebbi dunes, with a night in a desert camp.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/blue-city-to-sahara/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-alaritammsalu-37064558-705x540.jpg' alt='Blue City to Sahara' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-alaritammsalu-37064558-scaled.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>4 days</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>Blue City to Sahara</h3><p>From Tangier through Chefchaouen and Fes to Merzouga, then Todra, Dades and Ait Ben Haddou to Marrakech.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/5-day-sahara-trekking-adventure/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-tom-d-arby-3904203-68076461-705x540.jpg' alt='5-Day Sahara Trekking' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-tom-d-arby-3904203-68076461-scaled.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>5 days</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>5-Day Sahara Trekking</h3><p>Walking days in the desert, camels for the bags and nights under a lot of stars.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/8-day-morocco-desert-coast-escape/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.10.12-PM-705x540.jpeg' alt='8-Day Desert & Coast' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-06-at-9.10.12-PM.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>8 days</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>8-Day Desert &amp; Coast</h3><p>Sahara dunes, kasbahs and gorges, finishing with a few slow days on the Atlantic.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a><a class='am-trip' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/15-day-grand-morocco-discovery/'><div class='am-trip-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-the-trvlr-5614643-705x540.jpg' alt='15-Day Grand Morocco' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-the-trvlr-5614643-scaled.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'><span class='am-chip'>15 days</span></div><div class='am-trip-b'><h3>15-Day Grand Morocco</h3><p>The whole country in one trip: imperial cities, the mountains, the desert and the coast.</p><span class='am-go'>See the trip</span></div></a></div><div class='am-more-row'><a class='am-btn am-btn--ghost' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip-search-result/'>See all trips</a></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh05w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh am-sh--c'><span class='am-hand'>Moments from the road</span><h2>Real trips, <em>real people</em></h2><p>No stock photos here. These are our guests and our team, taken on the road with their phones.</p></div><div class='am-wall'><figure class='am-pol am-pa'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/amasir-guests-marrakech-airport.jpg' alt='Amasir Voyage guide with four smiling travellers at Marrakech Menara airport' width='1600' height='1200' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><figcaption>First hello at Marrakech airport</figcaption></figure><figure class='am-pol am-pb'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/sunset-jump-sahara-dunes.jpg' alt='Amasir Voyage guide jumping on top of a sand dune at sunset' width='1200' height='1600' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><figcaption>Someone always jumps at sunset</figcaption></figure><figure class='am-pol am-pc'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/family-trip-mountain-viewpoint-morocco.jpg' alt='Family of four with their Amasir Voyage guide at a mountain viewpoint' width='1200' height='1600' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><figcaption>A family day up in the mountains</figcaption></figure><figure class='am-pol am-pd'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/group-day-trip-morocco.jpg' alt='Group of young travellers smiling with their guide on a day trip' width='590' height='787' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><figcaption>Group day trip, all smiles</figcaption></figure><figure class='am-pol am-pe'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/family-group-marrakech-airport-departure.jpg' alt='Two families with their Amasir Voyage guide at Marrakech airport' width='1600' height='738' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><figcaption>The hardest part: goodbye at the airport</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh06w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--sand'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh'><div><span class='am-eb'>Activities</span><h2>Got a free <em>afternoon</em>?</h2></div><p>Short experiences around Marrakech. Book one on its own or add it to a day trip.</p></div><div class='am-acts'><a class='am-act' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/marrakech-hot-air-balloon-adventure/'><div class='am-act-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-leos-37736075-600x810.jpg' alt='Hot Air Balloon at Sunrise' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pexels-leos-37736075-scaled.jpg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'></div><h3>Hot Air Balloon at Sunrise</h3><p>An early start and a quiet hour above the plains as the sun comes up over the Atlas.</p><span class='am-go'>Details</span></a><a class='am-act' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/agafay-desert-dinner-live-show/'><div class='am-act-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.52-AM-600x810.jpeg' alt='Agafay Dinner & Live Show' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.52-AM.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'></div><h3>Agafay Dinner &amp; Live Show</h3><p>Sunset in the desert, a Moroccan dinner and music around the fire.</p><span class='am-go'>Details</span></a><a class='am-act' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/quad-biking/'><div class='am-act-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.51-AM2-600x810.jpeg' alt='Quad Biking' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.51-AM2.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'></div><h3>Quad Biking</h3><p>A couple of hours on desert tracks just outside the city.</p><span class='am-go'>Details</span></a><a class='am-act' href='https://amasirvoyage.com/trip/dromedary-ride/'><div class='am-act-i'><img src='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.51-AM1-600x810.jpeg' alt='Dromedary Ride' loading='lazy' data-full='https://amasirvoyage.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/WhatsApp-Image-2026-08-07-at-1.02.51-AM1.jpeg' onerror='this.onerror=null;this.src=this.dataset.full' decoding='async'></div><h3>Dromedary Ride</h3><p>A slow ride at golden hour. Good with kids, and the best photos of the day.</p><span class='am-go'>Details</span></a></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh07w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--white'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-sh'><div><span class='am-eb'>How it works</span><h2>Booking is a <em>conversation</em>, not a form</h2></div><p>No booking engine maze and no surprises on the day. You talk to us, we sort the rest.</p></div><div class='am-steps'><div class='am-step'><b>01</b><h3>Tell us your plan</h3><p>Dates, how many of you, and roughly what you'd like to see. A rough idea is plenty.</p></div><div class='am-step'><b>02</b><h3>We shape it together</h3><p>We send a day-by-day plan and a price. Change anything until it feels right.</p></div><div class='am-step'><b>03</b><h3>We pick you up</h3><p>At the airport, your riad or your hotel. From there, just enjoy the road.</p></div></div></div></section>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"},{"id":"amh08w","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<section class='am am-sec am-sec--white' style='padding-top:40px'><div class='am-w'><div class='am-cta'><div><span class='am-hand'>Yalla, let's plan it</span><h2>Tell us your dates. <em>We'll do the rest.</em></h2></div><div class='am-btns'><a class='am-btn am-btn--white' href='https://wa.me/212660751249?text=Hello%20Amasir%20Voyage%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20plan%20a%20trip' target='_blank' rel='noopener'><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'><path d='M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2